      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    returns = [1.5, -0.5, 3.2, -2.0, 0.8]\n    n = len(returns)\n    mean = sum(returns) / n\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    s2 = sum((x - mean) ** 2 for x in returns)\n    s4 = sum((x - mean) ** 4 for x in returns)\n    m2 = s2 / n\n    m4 = s4 / n\n    excess_kurtosis = (m4 / (m2 ** 2)) - 3\n\n    # Return answer rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(excess_kurtosis, 2)\n```",
